// Rule: [T1021.001][T1090] Nighteagle - RDP Virtual Channel Schema
// MITRE ATT&CK: T1021.001, T1090
// Classification: Validation query
// Status: Untested implementation sketch
// Primary platform: Microsoft Sentinel / Log Analytics
// Required telemetry: Event
// Purpose: Validates collection and raw representation of RdpCoreTS event IDs 132 and 148 before designing content logic for rdp2tcp or attacker-selected virtual-channel names.
// Logic: Evaluate Event for rdp virtual channel schema using the existing source-derived conditions while preserving projected investigation context.
// A match proves: A result proves that the published query conditions matched in Event; it is an investigative event, not a malicious verdict.
// A match does not prove: It does not establish malicious rdp2tcp use.
// Expected false positives: authorized administration, approved software, testing, or benign artifact collisions.
// Coverage limits: local schema, field population, retention, collection scope, and attacker variation require validation.
// Evidence claims: C001, C002, C003
//
// NightEagle / rdp2tcp virtual-channel telemetry validation
// Validation query - Untested implementation sketch
// Primary platform: Microsoft Sentinel / Log Analytics
// Required telemetry: Azure Monitor Agent DCR collecting
// Microsoft-Windows-RemoteDesktopServices-RdpCoreTS/Operational into Event
// Confidence: Medium
// A result establishes event collection only. It does not establish malicious rdp2tcp use.

Event
| where EventLog == "Microsoft-Windows-RemoteDesktopServices-RdpCoreTS/Operational"
| where EventID in (132, 148)
| project TimeGenerated, Computer, EventID, EventLog, Source,
          RenderedDescription, EventData, ParameterXml,
          UserName, _ResourceId
| order by TimeGenerated desc
